

1. AI Configuration & Defect Classes ⭐

IMG_SIZE = (224, 224)
BATCH_SIZE = 32
EPOCHS = 50
NUM_CLASSES = 5
LEARNING_RATE = 1e-4

DEFECT_CLASSES = [
    "NORMAL",
    "WARPING",
    "STRINGING",
    "LAYER_SHIFT",
    "CLOGGING"
]

Explanation

Defines the basic AI training configuration.

Images are standardized to 224×224 pixels.

Uses batch size of 32.

Model trains for a maximum of 50 epochs.

Uses 5 defect classes.

Learning rate is set to 0.0001.

These settings control how the CNN is trained.



