6. Model Compilation & Optimizer ⭐⭐⭐

self.model.compile(
    optimizer=keras.optimizers.Adam(
        learning_rate=LEARNING_RATE
    ),
    loss="sparse_categorical_crossentropy",
    metrics=["accuracy"]
)

Explanation

Uses Adam optimizer to update model weights.

Learning rate is 0.0001.

Uses sparse_categorical_crossentropy because we have multiple classes with integer labels.

Accuracy is used to monitor classification performance.



