self.model.fit(
    X_train,
    y_train,
    validation_data=(X_val, y_val),
    epochs=EPOCHS,
    batch_size=BATCH_SIZE,
    callbacks=cbs
)

Explanation

Trains the CNN using the training dataset.

Maximum training duration is 50 epochs.

Each batch contains 32 images.

Validation data checks performance during training.

The model learns by adjusting its weights after seeing training examples.


Training Controls

EarlyStopping(...)
ModelCheckpoint(...)
ReduceLROnPlateau(...)
TensorBoard(...)

Explanation

EarlyStopping: stops training when improvement stops.

ModelCheckpoint: saves the best-performing model.

ReduceLROnPlateau: reduces learning rate when learning slows.

TensorBoard: records training information for monitoring.



